     break opportunity, so on a narrow screen they must break mid-token. */
  .mcp-catalog__group li {
    min-width: 0;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  /* Three labelled groups rather than one six-item list: the facts answer three
     different questions (who gets access, how a client authenticates, what runs
     around it), and a reader looking for one of them was scanning all six. */
  .mcp-access {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--spacing-2xl);
